					<p class="body1" align="left"><span class="body1 style73"> <h2>News archive</h2><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-05-18 | Friday</font></strong><br><br>Peace y&#39;all, here&#39;s some more Massline-related videos that should hold you over for the weekend:<br /><strong><br /><a href="http://lineout.thestranger.com/2007/05/blue_scholars_fans_and_black_anger" target="_blank">HOW WAS IT?!?</a></strong>: Our man Larry from the Stranger hooked us up with a really funny vid while outside of the Showbox during the &quot;Bayani&quot; album release party.  <strong><br /><br /><a href="http://youtube.com/watch?v=K9kPsd6MqpE" target="_blank">Blue Scholars - Blue School</a></strong>: Watch this Ballard High School video project done to the tunes of &quot;Blue School&quot;. <br /><br /><a href="http://youtube.com/watch?v=xmYxaNd4B5k" target="_blank"><strong>RA Scion / Blake Lewis</strong></a>: Watch Blake Lewis (of American Idol) beatbox for Common Market&#39;s RA Scion at the &quot;Bayani&quot; album release party. Thanks M! <br /><br /><strong>Peace</strong><br />daps1<br /><br />p.s. shout out to Renton High School!<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-05-16 | Wednesday</font></strong><br><br>You might&#39;ve heard about it, so here it is...<strong>Geo</strong>&#39;s (in)famous stage dive at the end of Saturday&#39;s &quot;Bayani&quot; release party. Props to <strong>Jeff Brennan</strong> for the clip!<br /><br /><a href="http://www.vimeo.com/clip:190413">Blue Scholars perform No Rest for the Weary at the Showbox</a> from <a href="http://www.vimeo.com/user:193893">Jeff Brennan</a> on <a href="http://www.vimeo.com/">Vimeo</a><br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-05-14 | Monday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://farm1.static.flickr.com/192/495984307_470445dd70.jpg?v=0" alt="" width="334" height="500" /><br /><em>Deep Concentration. Photo by VBL.<br /><br /></em>What an exausting weekend -- two huge Bayani album release shows at The Showbox, with video and photo shoots inbetween. But like the song says, there&#39;s no rest for the weary, as your Massline artists embark on their West Coast Tour (info to your right). Thanks, peace, love and shout outs to everyone involved last weekend, especially The Showbox staff and security, Soundman Aaron, and the Merchanaries (led by their fearless leader, Bee).<br /><br />Who&#39;s feelin that Bayani album though? Post up your thoughts on the Massline forums!<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<br /><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-05-12 | Saturday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://farm1.static.flickr.com/202/495322097_61597ef119_o.jpg" alt="" width="430" /><br /><br />big up to our northend fammo blake lewis for comin thru on friday.  and bigger ups to all the folkers in the crowd who attended the release shows this weekend.<br /><br />(big up to daps on this clownin foto! lol)<br /><br />Saba<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-05-12 | Saturday</font></strong><br><br><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">AUTHENTIC, as my man E-Real from Black Anger would say. </p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">Peace to Fel for snapping <a href="http://photos.wishboxstudios.com/gallery/2835327">&nbsp;these photos last night</a>!</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">Let&#39;s do it again!</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="font: normal normal normal 12px/normal Helvetica; margin: 0px">Let&#39;s do it again!</p><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><center><div class="pagenumbers"><A HREF="archive.php?from=160">[&lt;&lt;]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=0">[1]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=5">[2]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=10">[3]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=15">[4]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=20">[5]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=25">[6]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=30">[7]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=35">[8]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=40">[9]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=45">[10]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=50">[11]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=55">[12]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=60">[13]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=65">[14]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=70">[15]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=75">[16]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=80">[17]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=85">[18]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=90">[19]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=95">[20]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=100">[21]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=105">[22]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=110">[23]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=115">[24]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=120">[25]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=125">[26]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=130">[27]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=135">[28]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=140">[29]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=145">[30]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=150">[31]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=155">[32]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=160">[33]</A> [34] <A HREF="archive.php?from=170">[35]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=175">[36]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=180">[37]</A> <A